 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Musai no Reijou Jobu [Maou] de Juurin Suru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "The Talentless Noble Lady Tramples On Everyone After Being Granted The [Demon King] Job"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Who would want to become the Demon King?!\"\n\nIn this world, social status is defined by supernatural abilities called [Blessings] bestowed by god. Born as the daughter to a ducal family, [Sheena] was someone that would've had a high status, but... for some reason, she was born without a [Blessing] and was oppressed her entire life.\n\nShe hated the world... She hated the humans... And in the midst of her despair, she was granted a [Blessing]ーTo become the [Demon King]. Trample on this world, and all of humanity."
  },
